000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. IPTCALC.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE MAINFRAME BILLING.
000400*================================================================
000500* IPTCALC  INSURANCE PREMIUM TAX
000600*
000700* CALLED BY PRMCALC AND PRMCALC0.
000800*   UK STANDARD RATE 12%.
000900*   UK HIGHER RATE 20% FOR TRAVEL (TRV) AND GADGET (GDG).
001000*   US POLICIES: NO IPT HERE. STATE PREMIUM TAX IS BILLED BY THE
001100*   US FRONTING CARRIER, NOT BY CORVANE.
001200* MARINE CARGO (MAR) IS EXEMPT IN THE UK.
001300* KEEP IN STEP WITH policy-admin QuoteService AND
001400* data/reference/ipt_rates.csv.
001500*================================================================
001600 DATA DIVISION.
001700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001800 01  WS-IPT-STANDARD             PIC 9V9999 VALUE 0.1200.
001900 01  WS-IPT-HIGHER               PIC 9V9999 VALUE 0.2000.
002000 LINKAGE SECTION.
002100 01  LK-LINE-CODE                PIC X(03).
002200 01  LK-REGION                   PIC X(02).
002300 01  LK-NET-PREMIUM              PIC S9(09)V99 COMP-3.
002400 01  LK-IPT-RATE                 PIC 9V9999 COMP-3.
002500 01  LK-IPT-AMT                  PIC S9(07)V99 COMP-3.
002600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-LINE-CODE LK-REGION LK-NET-PREMIUM
002700                          LK-IPT-RATE LK-IPT-AMT.
002800 0000-MAIN.
002900     EVALUATE TRUE
003000         WHEN LK-REGION NOT = 'UK'
003100             MOVE ZERO TO LK-IPT-RATE
003200         WHEN LK-LINE-CODE = 'MAR'
003300             MOVE ZERO TO LK-IPT-RATE
003400         WHEN LK-LINE-CODE = 'TRV' OR LK-LINE-CODE = 'GDG'
003500             MOVE WS-IPT-HIGHER TO LK-IPT-RATE
003600         WHEN OTHER
003700             MOVE WS-IPT-STANDARD TO LK-IPT-RATE
003800     END-EVALUATE
003900     COMPUTE LK-IPT-AMT ROUNDED = LK-NET-PREMIUM * LK-IPT-RATE
004000     GOBACK.
